      "created_at": "2022-11-17T22:35:19.697Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group quote-modified\" data-username=\"angramainyu\" data-post=\"5\" data-topic=\"29738\" data-full=\"true\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/d78d45/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> angramainyu:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Just add / and the seed number to the end of the URL, works with the bland table, e.g.:<br>\n<a href=\"https://sentinels.strongspearstrong.com/newherobland/5534239119706748174\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">New Hero</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ya. I’m suggesting the creator make the site do that automatically by default when it generates a new character.</p>",
